      "id": "code-001",
      "solutionStageId": "solution-002",
      "language": "cpp",
      "sourceKind": "shown_in_video",
      "completeness": "partial",
      "code": "/// Definition for singly-linked list.\nstruct ListNode {\n    int val;\n    ListNode *next;\n    ListNode(int x) : val(x), next(NULL) {}\n};\n\nclass Solution {\npublic:\n    ListNode* removeNthFromEnd(ListNode* head, int n) {\n        assert( n >= 0 );\n\n        ListNode* dummyHead = new ListNode(0);\n        dummyHead->next = head;\n\n        ListNode* p = dummyHead;\n        ListNode* q = dummyHead;\n        for( int i = 0 ; i < n + 1 ; i ++ ){\n            assert( q );\n            q = q->next;\n        }\n\n        while( q != NULL ){\n            p = p->next;\n            q = q->next;\n        }\n\n        ListNode* delNode = p->next;\n        p->next = delNode->next;\n        delete delNode;\n        // 此后的返回值与 dummyHead 清理代码未在可见画面中完整出现\n",
